program operator_subspace_control

tolerance 1e-10
input n: u64 range 1024..16777216
field p[i in n]: f64 = (0.25 + (cast(f64, (((i * 17) + 3) % 1024)) / 1024.0))
field q[i in n]: f64 = ((p[i] + p[i]) + ((p[periodic((i + 1), n)] + p[periodic((i + 1), n)]) + p[periodic((i + 2), n)]))
sum checksum[i in n]: f64 = q[i]
output checksum
test (1024) => { checksum = 3837.5 }
